{{!-- Pick the locale's hero partial and hand it the NQL filter it must run.

     Why the filter is assembled here and not inside each hero: a `{{#get}}` filter has to
     be a literal at the call site, and the inputs it depends on — the collection's language
     tag (via `locale`, or its absence on the root channel), `featured_only` and
     `featured_tag` — are all readable in this partial's own scope. The heroes stay
     per-locale because their label, date format and reading-time strings sit *inside*
     `{{#get}}` + `{{#foreach}}`, where a partial hash argument is dropped (measured; see
     docs/v3-roadmap.md, "What a partial argument can and cannot do"). `featuredFilter` is
     read at the heroes' own top level — the `{{#get}}` call itself — which is exactly where
     a hash argument does survive.

     Two settings, independent, and two kinds of channel, so eight combinations:

       channel        featured_only  featured_tag   filter
       ─────────────  ─────────────  ────────────   ──────────────────────────────────
       /en/ /es/ /br/ on  (default)  empty          featured:true+tag:<locale>
       /en/ /es/ /br/ on             my-tag         featured:true+tag:<locale>+tag:my-tag
       /en/ /es/ /br/ off            empty          tag:<locale>
       /en/ /es/ /br/ off            my-tag         tag:<locale>+tag:my-tag
       / (mixed feed) on  (default)  empty          featured:true
       / (mixed feed) on             my-tag         featured:true+tag:my-tag
       / (mixed feed) off            empty          (none — the newest post)
       / (mixed feed) off            my-tag         tag:my-tag

     `mixedFeed` is set only by home.hbs. `/` is intentionally the unfiltered, mixed feed
     (routes.yaml gives it no filter), so a language tag there is wrong: it made the root
     hero English-only while the grid below it was mixed. A locale collection keeps its tag
     — that is what keeps /es/ Spanish-only — and the custom tag is *added* (AND) there,
     never substituted for it. On the root channel there is no language tag to add to, so
     `featured_tag` is the only tag in the filter.

     The four locale combinations are unchanged, so /en/, /es/ and /br/ keep rendering
     byte-for-byte what they rendered before the root exemption. tests/featured-filter.test.mjs
     pins both contracts. --}}
{{#if mixedFeed}}
    {{!-- Root channel: no language tag. The English hero partial is the right one here
         because `/` renders inside default.hbs (English UI); only the *filter* is mixed. --}}
    {{#if @custom.featured_only}}
        {{#if @custom.featured_tag}}
            {{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
        {{else}}
            {{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter="featured:true"}}
        {{/if}}
    {{else}}
        {{#if @custom.featured_tag}}
            {{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
        {{else}}
            {{!-- Neither setting constrains the root hero: no filter at all, so `{{#get}}`
                 returns the newest post. That mirrors the locale collections, where turning
                 `featured_only` off also falls back to the newest post. --}}
            {{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=""}}
        {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
{{else}}
    {{#if @custom.featured_only}}
        {{#if @custom.featured_tag}}
            {{#match locale "=" "es"}}{{> "featured-hero-es" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
            {{else match locale "=" "br"}}{{> "featured-hero-br" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
            {{else}}{{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}{{/match}}
        {{else}}
            {{#match locale "=" "es"}}{{> "featured-hero-es" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale)}}
            {{else match locale "=" "br"}}{{> "featured-hero-br" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale)}}
            {{else}}{{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "featured:true+tag:" locale)}}{{/match}}
        {{/if}}
    {{else}}
        {{#if @custom.featured_tag}}
            {{#match locale "=" "es"}}{{> "featured-hero-es" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
            {{else match locale "=" "br"}}{{> "featured-hero-br" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}
            {{else}}{{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale "+tag:" @custom.featured_tag)}}{{/match}}
        {{else}}
            {{#match locale "=" "es"}}{{> "featured-hero-es" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale)}}
            {{else match locale "=" "br"}}{{> "featured-hero-br" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale)}}
            {{else}}{{> "featured-hero" featuredFilter=(concat "tag:" locale)}}{{/match}}
        {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
{{/if}}
